{"schema":"memento.relay-facts.v1","models":{"claude-instant-1.2":{"n":"Claude Instant 1.2","f":[{"k":"name","t":"Claude Instant 1.2","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/index/releasing-claude-instant-1-2","https://www.anthropic.com/news/introducing-claude","https://anthropic.com/index/100k-context-windows"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"Anthropic","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/index/releasing-claude-instant-1-2","https://www.anthropic.com/news/introducing-claude","https://anthropic.com/index/100k-context-windows"]},{"k":"release","t":"2023-08","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/index/releasing-claude-instant-1-2","https://www.anthropic.com/news/introducing-claude","https://anthropic.com/index/100k-context-windows"]},{"k":"specs.knowledge_cutoff","t":"early 2023 (unofficial; no Anthropic statement for Instant 1.2)","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/index/releasing-claude-instant-1-2","https://www.anthropic.com/news/introducing-claude","https://anthropic.com/index/100k-context-windows"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"100000","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/index/releasing-claude-instant-1-2","https://www.anthropic.com/news/introducing-claude","https://anthropic.com/index/100k-context-windows"]},{"k":"specs.languages","t":"Mainly English; multilingual ability that Anthropic said improved in 1.2","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/index/releasing-claude-instant-1-2","https://www.anthropic.com/news/introducing-claude","https://anthropic.com/index/100k-context-windows"]},{"k":"family","t":"Claude Instant","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/index/releasing-claude-instant-1-2","https://www.anthropic.com/news/introducing-claude","https://anthropic.com/index/100k-context-windows"]},{"k":"predecessor","t":"Claude Instant 1.1","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/index/releasing-claude-instant-1-2","https://www.anthropic.com/news/introducing-claude","https://anthropic.com/index/100k-context-windows"]},{"k":"status","t":"retired","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/index/releasing-claude-instant-1-2","https://www.anthropic.com/news/introducing-claude","https://anthropic.com/index/100k-context-windows"]},{"k":"availability.real","t":"none","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"successor","t":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"availability.retired_on","t":"2024-11-06","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"summary","t":"Claude Instant 1.2は、2023年8月にAnthropicがAPI向けに出した「速くて安い」Claudeです。カジュアルな対話、要約、長文の読み取りに使われました。Claude 2の強みを取り込み、1.1より長く構造立てて答え、書式の指示にもよく従ったとされます。実力はGPT-3.5と同程度とみなされ、長いドキュメントからのデータ抽出や、Poeのカスタムボットの土台など、目立たない裏方として働きました。","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/index/releasing-claude-instant-1-2","https://www.anthropic.com/news/introducing-claude","https://anthropic.com/index/100k-context-windows"]},{"k":"persona.verbosity.0","t":"Anthropic reports longer responses than Instant 1.1.","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/releasing-claude-instant-1-2"]},{"k":"persona.formatting_habits.0","t":"Anthropic reports more structured responses and better adherence to formatting instructions than Instant 1.1.","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/releasing-claude-instant-1-2"]},{"k":"persona.interface.0","t":"chat","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/releasing-claude-instant-1-2"]},{"k":"persona.typical_strengths.0","t":"Anthropic describes dialogue, text analysis, summarization and document comprehension as uses.","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/releasing-claude-instant-1-2"]},{"k":"traits.safety.0","t":"そのまま頼まれた有害な依頼はほぼ確実に断る。SORRY-Benchでの応諾率は7.73%で、Claude 2系に近い拒否の多さだった。","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/index/releasing-claude-instant-1-2","https://arxiv.org/html/2406.14598","https://arxiv.org/html/2404.02151v1"]},{"k":"traits.reasoning.1","t":"推論力はGPT-3.5と同程度かやや上か下という中堅クラス。日常的な数学やコードはこなせる(GSM8K 86.7%、Codex 58.7%)が、高度な推論や込み入った多段の議論には弱い。","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/index/releasing-claude-instant-1-2","https:/